==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|sub-liminal}}

===Etymology===
Morphologically {{m|en|sub-}} + {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|līmen||threshold}} (genitive {{m|la|limen|līminis}}) + {{m|en|-al}}, a [[calque]] of {{cog|de|unterschwellig||beneath the threshold}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{lb|en|of a stimulus}} Below the [[threshold]] of [[conscious]] [[perception]], especially if still able to produce a [[response]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|underthreshold}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|superliminal}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|subliminal advertising}}
* {{l|en|subliminally}}
* {{l|en|subliminal message}}

